# Comeback Queen (jeuno 98) at Prog 0 against the crafted Dancer artifact hidden quest (Crafted_Dancer_Artifact.lua,
# still Lua: The Road to Divadom completed and a Dancer). HQuest[DncArtifact]Prog 1 (a GM): Olgald plays the hidden
# quest's 10167 (progressEvent, priority 1000, over 10146 at 995), its finish sets HQuest Prog 2 and Status 7; then the
# hidden quest's 10168 (event, priority 100, once per zone) loses to Comeback Queen's 10146 (setPriority 995).
lists UpperJeuno/Olgald/onTrigger UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/10167
char zone=UpperJeuno pos=-52.5,0,101 job=DNC lvl=75
quest Jeuno.LakesideMinuet completed
quest Jeuno.TheUnfinishedWaltz completed
quest Jeuno.TheRoadToDivadom completed
quest Jeuno.ComebackQueen accepted
charvar HQuest[DncArtifact]Prog 1
login
trigger Olgald                          # HQuest Prog 1: the hidden quest's 10167
finish                                  # HQuest Prog 2, Status 7
trigger Olgald                          # 10146 (995) over the hidden quest's 10168 (100)
finish
trigger Olgald                          # 10146 again (10168's once per zone would be spent anyway)
finish
